{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/webpack/webpack/issues/3116","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/webpack/webpack","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/webpack/webpack/issues/3116/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/webpack/webpack/issues/3116/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/webpack/webpack/issues/3116/events","html_url":"https://github.com/webpack/webpack/issues/3116","id":182155451,"node_id":"MDU6SXNzdWUxODIxNTU0NTE=","number":3116,"title":"Indexed access to star import is miscompiled in webpack 2","user":{"login":"Jessidhia","id":73085,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczMDg1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/73085?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jessidhia","html_url":"https://github.com/Jessidhia","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jessidhia/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jessidhia/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jessidhia/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jessidhia/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jessidhia/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jessidhia/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jessidhia/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jessidhia/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jessidhia/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":1089820,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMDg5ODIw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/webpack/webpack/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"fbca04","default":true,"description":null},{"id":398105880,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzOTgxMDU4ODA=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/webpack/webpack/labels/X4:%20work%20required","name":"X4: work required","color":"c2e0c6","default":false,"description":null},{"id":428472762,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw0Mjg0NzI3NjI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/webpack/webpack/labels/S4:%20Broken","name":"S4: Broken","color":"0052cc","default":false,"description":null},{"id":428472954,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw0Mjg0NzI5NTQ=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/webpack/webpack/labels/P0:%20Critical","name":"P0: Critical","color":"b60205","default":false,"description":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2016-10-11T01:56:36Z","updated_at":"2016-11-15T16:44:32Z","closed_at":"2016-11-15T16:44:32Z","author_association":"MEMBER","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"This is very easy to reproduce with coffeescript 1.11's import/export syntax support, as while the syntax will just be emitted as is, actual use of the module record will be subjected to [coffeescript's es3-compatible output](http://coffeescript.org/#try:import%20*%20as%20a%20from%20'b'%0Aa.a.b%28%29%20%23%20works%0Aa.default.b%28%29%20%23%20is%20compiled%20to%20a.b%28%29%0Aa%5B'a'%5D.b%28%29%20%23%20is%20also%20compiled%20to%20a.b%28%29), which will convert `a.default` into `a['default']`.\n\nIn real code terms:\n\n``` coffee\nstore.default.dispatch(unfollowUser(@user_id))\n```\n\nis translated to:\n\n``` js\nstore[\"default\"].dispatch(unfollowUser(this.user_id));\n```\n\nwhich webpack compiles to:\n\n``` js\n__WEBPACK_IMPORTED_MODULE_3_store__.dispatch(__webpack_require__.i(__WEBPACK_IMPORTED_MODULE_4_actions_user_unfollow__[\"b\" /* default */])(this.user_id))\n```\n\nthat errors out at runtime with:\n\n```\nTypeError: __WEBPACK_IMPORTED_MODULE_3_store__.dispatch is not a function. (In '__WEBPACK_IMPORTED_MODULE_3_store__.dispatch(__webpack_require__.i(__WEBPACK_IMPORTED_MODULE_4_actions_user_unfollow__[\"b\" /* default */])(this.user_id))', '__WEBPACK_IMPORTED_MODULE_3_store__.dispatch' is undefined)\n```\n\ndue to the missing `[\"a\" /* default */]`. The same happens with any indexed symbol access, but is impossible to avoid with `.default` access in coffeescript, other than by making a separate `import theDefault from 'module'`.\n","closed_by":{"login":"sokra","id":1365881,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNjU4ODE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1365881?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sokra","html_url":"https://github.com/sokra","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sokra/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sokra/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sokra/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sokra/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sokra/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sokra/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sokra/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sokra/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sokra/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/webpack/webpack/issues/3116/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/webpack/webpack/issues/3116/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}